From 2cde2a88e9799bd3565d31d33cde437cacd5c65d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 21:01:42 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] NOOVERLAP-C (web): Setup pages overlaps removed (golden
 aligns, FormShow visibility, layout)

EastSun 20260930: overlapping controls are not allowed.
- Setup.SetUp.html: form = golden client 1074x948 (was 1082x956, so the
  alClient grpHandlingMode ran into Panel5); labYOffset / edYOffset /
  rgYOffset / rgYPitchOffsetMode / palVisibleIndex start hidden like golden
  ScrollBar1Change (cSetUp.cpp:386-411, ht9045_setup_sitemap.js shows them
  per Test Mode); palVisibleIndex's cover-an-item trick drawn without the
  overlap; the three top groups shortened by the 4px the layout base
  moves them down.
- Setup.TrayForm.html: only the tray / device picture of the checked
  direction is shown (golden rgTrayDirClick / rgDeviceDirClick,
  cTrayForm.cpp:735-783; dfm Visible=False); cbUseThickTray moved off the
  tray drawing; YST / YPitch / TpThick 2px narrower.
- Setup.AGV.html: Panel2 anchored like alBottom; edAuto1..3Count 20 high
  (golden 24 at a 20px pitch).
- Setup.Ld_ULd.html: grpLoader / grpUnloader / Panel3 follow the alLeft /
  alBottom aligns; lblUnit stays inside Panel3.
- Setup.TesterIF.html: Panel39 / pnlRS232 drawn at the size VCL shows.
- Status.TowerLight.html: Bevel1..4 start below Panel11 (golden paints
  Panel11 over their top 3px); palART drawn 31 high like VCL clips it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 page/Setup.AGV.html         |  2 +-
 page/Setup.Ld_ULd.html      |  2 +-
 page/Setup.SetUp.html       |  9 +++++++--
 page/Setup.TesterIF.html    |  2 +-
 page/Setup.TrayForm.html    | 14 +++++++++++++-
 page/Status.TowerLight.html |  2 +-
 6 files changed, 24 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

